#: cf23c885cf954acebbc52c994027e85c
msgid "Log based Calibration"
msgstr "基于日志的校准"

#: ../../source/docs/common-optical-flow-sensor-setup.rst:81
#: 1769d4607a5f467e8c5b6a098c242b2b
msgid "To calibrate the sensor using Log file data please follow these steps:"
msgstr "要使用日志文件数据校准传感器，请按以下步骤操作："

#: ../../source/docs/common-optical-flow-sensor-setup.rst:83
#: ed0f23820aa744df97ee137614776e0b
msgid ""
"Connect to your autopilot and ensure that logging while disarmed is enabled "
"by setting :ref:`LOG_DISARMED <copter:LOG_DISARMED>` to 1"
msgstr ""
"连接到飞控，通过将 :ref:`LOG_DISARMED <copter:LOG_DISARMED>` 设置为 1 确保已启用上锁状态下的日志记录"

#: ../../source/docs/common-optical-flow-sensor-setup.rst:86
#: 78f667d32f4344e0a229f8a34bf31763
msgid ""
"Find a location with a textured surface and good lighting (natural light or "
"strong incandescent)"
msgstr "找一个有纹理表面和良好光照（自然光或强白炽灯）的位置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-optical-flow-sensor-setup.rst:88
#: a88d062fc31f48329a70e44d1a88cf26
msgid "Remove Propellers (safety first)"
msgstr "拆下螺旋桨（安全第一）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-optical-flow-sensor-setup.rst:89
#: 03f40fe45254415c963f446b18094d40
msgid ""
"Power on the vehicle and hold level away from your body and at eye level"
msgstr "为飞行器上电，保持水平，远离身体并保持在眼睛平视高度"

#: ../../source/docs/common-optical-flow-sensor-setup.rst:90
#: ef64c47cdf3e495ba4dfb4feb59fe711
msgid ""
"Rotate about the vehicle in roll through a range from -15 to +15 degrees in "
"about a second and then back again. Repeat this 5 to 10 times. By closing "
"one eye you will be able to keep the centre of the sensor stationary against"
" the background while you do the rotation."
msgstr ""
"绕横滚轴在约 -15 到 +15 度范围内旋转飞行器，大约一秒内完成，然后返回。重复 5 到 10 "
"次。闭上一只眼睛，您将能够在旋转时保持传感器中心相对背景静止。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-optical-flow-sensor-setup.rst:96
#: 0c25a6e907bf4bca9b1b664a7b4effef
msgid "Repeat  about the vehicle pitch axis."
msgstr "绕俯仰轴重复上述操作。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-optical-flow-sensor-setup.rst:97
#: 6c6665694d254c8f9818dca842764e99
msgid ""
"Download the data flash logs and plot the ``OF.flowX``, ``OF.bodyX`` and "
"``IMU.GyrX`` data. It should look something like this:"
msgstr ""
"下载 DataFlash 日志，绘制 ``OF.flowX``、``OF.bodyX`` 和 ``IMU.GyrX`` 数据。它应该看起来像这样："

#: ../../source/docs/common-optical-flow-sensor-setup.rst:103
#: da79dcbaebc944ceb08c9260335cba07
msgid ""
"If ``OF.flowX`` is larger or smaller than ``OF.bodyX``, then it can be "
"adjusted by changing the ``FLOW_FXSCALER`` parameter"
msgstr "如果 ``OF.flowX`` 大于或小于 ``OF.bodyX``，可以通过更改 ``FLOW_FXSCALER`` 参数进行调整"

#: ../../source/docs/common-optical-flow-sensor-setup.rst:105
#: 0217428ed1844a9583dd4a2a386c8651
msgid ""
"IF ``OF.bodyX`` is uncorrelated or opposite sign to ``IMU.GyrX``, the "
":ref:`FLOW_ORIENT_YAW <copter:FLOW_ORIENT_YAW>` parameter is probably set "
"incorrectly or you do not have the flow sensor pointing downwards"
msgstr ""
"如果 ``OF.bodyX`` 与 ``IMU.GyrX`` 不相关或符号相反，则 :ref:`FLOW_ORIENT_YAW "
"<copter:FLOW_ORIENT_YAW>` 参数可能设置不正确，或者光流传感器未朝下"

#: ../../source/docs/common-optical-flow-sensor-setup.rst:108
#: aabf5765644f499aa38d4a0bde67e69c
msgid ""
"Plot the ``OF.flowY``, ``OF.bodyYband``, ``IMU.GyrY`` data. It should look "
"something like this:"
msgstr "绘制 ``OF.flowY``、``OF.bodyYband``、``IMU.GyrY`` 数据。它应该看起来像这样："

#: ../../source/docs/common-optical-flow-sensor-setup.rst:114
#: e77671dc7b1a46d9a335caa55db296f2
msgid ""
"If ``OF.flowY`` is larger or smaller than ``OF.bodyY``, then it can be "
"adjusted by changing the ``FLOW_FYSCALER`` parameter"
msgstr "如果 ``OF.flowY`` 大于或小于 ``OF.bodyY``，可以通过更改 ``FLOW_FYSCALER`` 参数进行调整"

#: ../../source/docs/common-optical-flow-sensor-setup.rst:116
#: 420a287f86de4e008b22d288ab44dcd3
msgid ""
"IF ``OF.bodyY`` is uncorrelated or opposite sign to ``IMU.GyrY``, the "
":ref:`FLOW_ORIENT_YAW <copter:FLOW_ORIENT_YAW>` parameter is probably set "
"incorrectly or you do not have the flow sensor pointing downwards"
msgstr ""
"如果 ``OF.bodyY`` 与 ``IMU.GyrY`` 不相关或符号相反，则 :ref:`FLOW_ORIENT_YAW "
"<copter:FLOW_ORIENT_YAW>` 参数可能设置不正确，或者光流传感器未朝下"

#: ../../source/docs/common-optical-flow-sensor-setup.rst:122
#: c1d1bdb019094d468ad04cdd64b2d0c2
msgid "Range Sensor Check"
msgstr "测距传感器检查"

#: ../../source/docs/common-optical-flow-sensor-setup.rst:124
#: 79a7aa7ecd024c5e8626d94c6d3be332
msgid ""
"Check the ``EKF5.meaRng`` message in the flashlog from your flow sensor "
"calibration test. Check the following:"
msgstr "检查光流传感器校准测试飞行的 DataFlash 日志中的 ``EKF5.meaRng`` 消息。检查以下内容："

#: ../../source/docs/common-optical-flow-sensor-setup.rst:127
#: 29d1f1fa2b0449969e2e8cabbdb687ad
msgid "There is continuous range measurement."
msgstr "有连续的测距读数。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-optical-flow-sensor-setup.rst:128
#: 6d8f7789f17d45bbb54ef2aced402cb5
msgid ""
"It outputs a range on the ground that is 10cm of the expected value "
"(remember that measured range will increase when you roll or pitch the "
"vehicle because the laser is then measuring on a slant)"
msgstr "在地面输出的测距值在预期值的 10cm 以内（记住，当您横滚或俯仰飞行器时，由于激光是斜着测量的，测量距离会增大）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-optical-flow-sensor-setup.rst:135
#: 91bd2f1587804d0ea5847956c6222e70
msgid "Pre-Arm checks"
msgstr "解锁前检查"

#: ../../source/docs/common-optical-flow-sensor-setup.rst:137
#: 71f18ea014bc466c9d84b8baaf5ea0c6
msgid ""
"To allow arming and taking off in Loiter without a GPS the GPS arming check "
"should be turned off as shown below.  Unchecking \"All\" and \"GPS\" and "
"leave all other options checked."
msgstr ""
"要允许在没有 GPS 的情况下在 Loiter 中解锁和起飞，应关闭 GPS 解锁检查，如下所示。取消勾选「所有」和「GPS」，保留其他所有选项勾选。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-optical-flow-sensor-setup.rst:145
#: cbfe074f52ce4ffbb7f32f3cd2f96643
msgid "First Flight"
msgstr "首次飞行"

#: ../../source/docs/common-optical-flow-sensor-setup.rst:147
#: 2f02124c23794df385fdb906764470eb
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`EK3_SRC1_VELXY <EK3_SRC1_VELXY>` = 0 (we don't want the optical "
"flow being used by the EKF at this stage)"
msgstr "将 :ref:`EK3_SRC1_VELXY <EK3_SRC1_VELXY>` 设置为 0（在此阶段我们不希望 EKF 使用光流）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-optical-flow-sensor-setup.rst:148
#: 6b98af86ceb44b56977e02fd5d838606
msgid ""
"Perform a short test flight hovering in STABILIZE or AltHold for copter, or "
"QSTABILIZE or QHOVER for QuadPlane, at small lean angles at heights ranging "
"from 50cm to 3m with"
msgstr ""
"在 Stabilize 或 AltHold（多旋翼），或 QSTABILIZE 或 QHOVER（QuadPlane）模式下进行短暂测试飞行，在 "
"50cm 到 3m 高度范围内以小倾角悬停"

#: ../../source/docs/common-optical-flow-sensor-setup.rst:149
#: c6a9fa278b6841c9b700adce9bded545
msgid "Download the flash log and plot the following in mission planner"
msgstr "下载 Flash 日志，在 Mission Planner 中绘制以下数据"

#: ../../source/docs/common-optical-flow-sensor-setup.rst:150
#: 9f49f0fe43af480fa0f6aa9c11ddc632
msgid "EKF5.meaRng should correlate with the change in vehicle height"
msgstr "EKF5.meaRng 应与飞行器高度变化相关"

#: ../../source/docs/common-optical-flow-sensor-setup.rst:151
#: 674b30658f2049afb3e80f16c3de8443
msgid "``OF.flowX`` and ``OF.flowY`` should be varying"
msgstr "``OF.flowX`` 和 ``OF.flowY`` 应该在变化"

#: ../../source/docs/common-optical-flow-sensor-setup.rst:152
#: 73f118e8bbe741989abd0433c9df516c
msgid ""
"``OF.bodyX`` and ``OF.bodyY`` should be consistent with IMU.GyrX and "
"IMU.GyrY"
msgstr "``OF.bodyX`` 和 ``OF.bodyY`` 应与 IMU.GyrX 和 IMU.GyrY 保持一致"

#: ../../source/docs/common-optical-flow-sensor-setup.rst:155
#: 17667261fc0244b6a8a28a6aa7c32923
msgid "Second Flight"
msgstr "第二次飞行"

#: ../../source/docs/common-optical-flow-sensor-setup.rst:159
#: 14b76aaf602443559afdc7b5168f863d
msgid ""
"You will need at least 15m of clear space around the vehicle to do this "
"flight safely. If the optical flow velocity estimates are bad, you will have"
" little warning and the copter may lean to its maximum lean angle very "
"quickly."
msgstr ""
"进行此飞行需要飞行器周围至少 15m 的空旷空间以确保安全。如果光流速度估计不准确，您将几乎没有预警，飞行器可能非常迅速地倾斜到最大倾斜角。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-optical-flow-sensor-setup.rst:162
#: ff341912e8e446c5ab2d76232cdf9fba
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`EK3_SRC1_VELXY <EK3_SRC1_VELXY>` = 5 and :ref:`EK3_SRC1_POSXY "
"<EK3_SRC1_POSXY>` = 0 to make the EKF ignore GPS and use the flow sensor"
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`EK3_SRC1_VELXY <EK3_SRC1_VELXY>` 设置为 5，:ref:`EK3_SRC1_POSXY "
"<EK3_SRC1_POSXY>` 设置为 0，使 EKF 忽略 GPS 而使用光流传感器"

