msgstr "将 :ref:`EK3_SRC1_POSZ <EK3_SRC1_POSZ>` 设置为 1（主垂直位置来自气压计）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-optical-flow-sensor-setup.rst:183
#: 9d530765eaa54412885fb8a96a2f8d25
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`EK3_SRC1_VELZ <EK3_SRC1_VELZ>` = 0 (No primary vertical velocity "
"sensor)"
msgstr "将 :ref:`EK3_SRC1_VELZ <EK3_SRC1_VELZ>` 设置为 0（无主垂直速度传感器）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-optical-flow-sensor-setup.rst:184
#: 650e42efce224e07a13736e31c605102
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`EK3_SRC1_YAW <EK3_SRC1_YAW>` = 1 (Primary yaw/heading from "
