#: ../../source/docs/common-optical-flow-sensor-setup.rst:189
#: 98ac26e02db5465391246a5b01127e0e
msgid ""
"When Copters have an optical flow sensor enabled (along with a rangefinder) "
"and it is specified as the only horizontal position source (e.g. "
"``EK3_SRCx_VELXY``=OpticalFlow and ``EK3_SRCx_POSXY``=None) and the vehicle "
"is flying in a pilot controlled mode requiring a position estimate (ie "
"Loiter or PosHold) the vehicle will not climb above the rangefinder's "
"maximum altitude specified in ``RNGFNDx_MAX``. This is a safety mechanism "
"because otherwise the EKF failsafe would trigger as the vehicle flew out of "
"rangefinder range."
msgstr ""
"当多旋翼启用光流传感器（同时有测距仪）且指定为唯一水平位置来源（例如 ``EK3_SRCx_VELXY`` =光流 且 "
"``EK3_SRCx_POSXY`` =无），并在需要位置估计的飞手控制模式（如 Loiter 或 PosHold）下飞行时，飞行器不会爬升到 "
"``RNGFNDx_MAX`` 中指定的测距仪最大高度以上。这是一种安全机制，否则当飞行器飞出测距仪量程时 EKF 失控保护会触发。"

